================================================================================

[INPUT TASK - PHASE 1]
"Analyze the data in my file."  (Ambiguous — no file specified)

[TURN 1 — ask_user]
  Agent Reasoning: File path not specified — cannot proceed without it.
  Action: ask_user "Which file would you like me to analyze?
                   Please provide the full path or filename."
  State:  PeTTa records:
            (ClarificationState awaiting "Which file...")
            (PendingGoal "Analyze the data in my file.")
            (PendingPlan "pending")
          Task SUSPENDED — not discarded.
  UI:     "CLARIFICATION NEEDED" panel appears in sidebar.
          Original task preserved in &conversation AtomSpace.

[USER RESPONSE - PHASE 2]
  User types: "/tmp/dataset.txt"

[TURN 2 — Resumption]
  Controller detects: state-is-awaiting-clarification = true
  Calls: resume-after-clarification "default" "/tmp/dataset.txt" 25
  PeTTa clears clarification state.
  Constructs: combined_goal = "Analyze the data in my file. [User provided clarification: /tmp/dataset.txt]"
  New cognitive-step begins with this combined goal.

[TURN 3 — read_file]
  Action: use_tool read_file ("/tmp/dataset.txt")
  Result: [success] Dataset: [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]

[TURN 4 — analysis]
  Action: use_tool word_counter ("Dataset: [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]")
  Result: [success] Word count: 4, Character count: 30

[TURN 5 — answer]
  Content: "Analysis of /tmp/dataset.txt:
  Content: 'Dataset: [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]'
  Word count: 4 | Character count: 30
  Values detected: 10, 20, 30, 40, 50 (5 numeric items)"

[COMPLETION RECORD]
Status:         completed
Turn Count:     5 (1 clarification + 4 task execution)
Clarification:  TRUE pause/resume — task was suspended, not discarded
State Preserved: PendingGoal, clarification question in &conversation AtomSpace
Resumption:     Correct — answer incorporated into original goal context
Answer treated: As clarification continuation, NOT a new unrelated task

[REQUIREMENT COVERAGE]
✅ R14: Missing information triggers clarification instead of guessing
✅ R-C: ask_user causes true task suspension and resume
✅ R-C: Completed steps, pending steps, and clarification state all persisted
